;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">的真实问题。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img style=\"width: 423px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=60ed3e41&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fj7RlD5l5q1w3ZGChibO6KiczgdH0N8P421gUEerdxsgfakafU6gichbw5LkRwH2OBlPNLdxiar4rcbLjiaAKjPdibsUozIiblcfUaNKJT1lvRjYKIw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">Agent 正从概念验证走向实际生产，各行各业的关注点也从跑通转向稳定运行、完整交付和规模化复用。千问 AI Arena 关注的正是 Agent 解决真实问题的能力，旨在挖</span></span></span><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">掘各行各业中真正可落地的Agent方案，并将优秀成果沉淀为行业可复用的能力。</span></span></span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>首发跨境电商任务，挖掘一键出海Agent</span></p></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">千问 AI Arena将持续上线不同行业、不同场景的挑战任务，每个任务明确输入数据、交付标准、运行环境和评测规则。开发者提交的Agent在统一环境中运行和评测，结果通过榜单公开展示，优秀方案有机会进入千问AI生态体系。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">平台的首个挑战任务聚焦跨境电商。开发者需构建一个可独立运行的Agent，在输入商品原始信息后，一次生成面向美国、韩国和巴西三个市场的目标电商平台全套上架素材，包括英语、韩语和葡萄牙语商品文案各一份，以及主图、详情图和商品视频。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">千问AI平台为参与者提供任务所需的Token额度，并开放覆盖文本、图像和视频生成的多模态模型能力。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><img style=\"width: 748px;height: 561px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=d562b3c5&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fj7RlD5l5q1zUia9dvlt5KWsIialu29UmWAfLhVh6icX1icgfWuwWQKuzpic7OfzwTDJIDMyc7ltYmcLWkMUiaNlDfWKicwW8KticcIUtvpUOY96qmbg%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></span></p><div style=\"color: rgb(255, 104, 39);font-size: 17px;line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"padding: 3px;display: inline-block;border-bottom: 5px solid rgb(255, 104, 39);line-height: 1.75;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>机器打榜+专家盲审，奖励等值数万美元Token</span></p></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">千问AI Arena创新推出Agent机器评测能力，与专家评审相结合。该机器评测引擎支持海内外平台调用，评测维度不仅覆盖文本，还拓展至图片、视频等多模态内容的业务场景契合度分析，全方位衡量Agent的真实交付水平。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">机器评测预计于8月中旬启动，对提交作品进行自动化评测并打榜；榜单前30名作品将在8月31日至9月中旬进入专家评审阶段，重点考察方案在真实业务中的可用性。结果于9月11日后公布。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">本期挑战设金奖1名、银奖2名、铜奖2名，分别获得等值1万美元、5,000美元和3,000美元的Token额度。优秀方案有机会获得商业化落地路径，成为阿里云AI生态合作伙伴，并在2026云栖大会现场颁奖与展示。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &#x22;PingFang SC&#x22;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x22;Helvetica Neue&#x22;, &#x22;Hiragino Sans GB&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei UI&#x22;, &#x22;Microsoft YaHei&#x22;, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;col